9.1. Coupled Dynamics

The eight proposals coalesce into a single dynamical system:

\begin{aligned}
\text{Micro:}&\quad dX_t^i = f(X_t^i,\alpha_t^i,m_t,G_t)dt+\sigma dW_t^i,\\
